update public.products set image_url = '/images/clarity3.png', rich_content = '{"faq":[{"answer":"No. The mental clarity comes purely from the natural nootropic compounds in the mushrooms, so you will not experience jitteriness or a racing heart.","question":"Does it contain caffeine?"},{"answer":"The functional extracts are adaptogenic and help regulate the nervous system. Even so, we recommend taking them in the first half of the day.","question":"Will it affect my sleep?"}],"reviews":[{"date":"08 August 2026","author":"George I.","rating":5,"comment":"I replaced my second coffee of the day with this extract. Incredible focus - I can spend 4 hours glued to the monitor without losing concentration."},{"date":"17 July 2026","author":"Diana M.","rating":5,"comment":"Very good for students during exams! I recommend it 100%."}],"banner_text":"Top mental clarity, steady energy and zero brain fog!","content_image":"/clarity3.png","why_recommend":["100% fruiting body extract (no grain-grown mycelium)","Dual extraction to maximize the active compounds","An adaptogenic effect: it calms and focuses you at the same time"],"ingredients_table":[{"vnr":"**","name":"Concentrated extract (dual extract 10:1)","quantity":"1000 mg"},{"vnr":"**","name":"Active beta-glucans","quantity":"300 mg"},{"vnr":"**","name":"V-Caps® capsule","quantity":"100 mg"},{"vnr":"**","name":"Bamboo extract (source of silicon)","quantity":"25 mg"},{"vnr":"**","name":"Organic rice powder","quantity":"30 mg"}],"intro_description":"<p>Enjoy deep concentration, a sharp memory and mental clarity without the energy crashes that come with caffeine. Our standardized extracts from functional mushrooms and adaptogens are superfoods for your brain.</p><p>It supports neurogenesis (the formation of new neurons) and clears away the “brain fog” even on the busiest and most stressful working days.</p>"}'::jsonb where id = '93728854-2bd9-401f-8f91-1d1330af3431';
update public.products set image_url = '/images/longevity3.png', rich_content = '{"faq":[{"answer":"For the best results we recommend taking 1-2 NMN capsules in the morning, on an empty stomach, with a glass of water. NMN is an energizing molecule, which is why it is not advisable to take it late in the evening, as it may affect the quality of your sleep.","question":"When and how should NMN be taken?"},{"answer":"Most users report a rise in energy levels and better mental clarity within the first 7-10 days of consistent use. The deeper anti-aging effects at the cellular level build up after 2-3 months of regular use.","question":"How soon will I see the first results?"},{"answer":"No. Our formula is synthesized through an advanced enzymatic process and is heat-stabilized. The product can be kept at room temperature, in a dry place away from direct sunlight, and will retain its purity of >99%.","question":"Does your NMN need to be kept refrigerated?"}],"reviews":[{"date":"12 June 2026","author":"Michael V.","rating":5,"comment":"I started taking it 3 weeks ago. The most obvious effect is that I no longer get that energy crash at 3pm. I feel much more alert at the office and I seem to recover faster after the gym."},{"date":"03 May 2026","author":"Elena D.","rating":5,"comment":"I take NMN together with resveratrol and the results are excellent. The capsules have no unpleasant taste and go down easily. I really appreciate that you provide the certificate of purity analysis!"},{"date":"18 April 2026","author":"Robert S.","rating":4,"comment":"A very good, high quality product. The only downside is that delivery was one day late on a single occasion, but otherwise the product does exactly what it promises: clean energy all day long."}],"banner_text":"Rebuild your energy reserves at the cellular level with the longevity molecule!","content_image":"/longevity3.png","why_recommend":["Independently tested purity > 99%","A heat-stabilized formula, with no need for refrigeration","Maximum absorption thanks to the gastro-resistant capsules","Contains no heavy metals, gluten or GMOs"],"ingredients_table":[{"vnr":"**","name":"B-Nicotinamide Mononucleotide (NMN)","quantity":"500 mg"},{"vnr":"**","name":"Black Pepper Extract (BioPerine)","quantity":"5 mg"},{"vnr":"**","name":"Vegetable capsule (HPMC)","quantity":"120 mg"},{"vnr":"**","name":"Organic rice flour (bulking agent)","quantity":"45 mg"},{"vnr":"**","name":"L-Leucine (natural lubricant)","quantity":"10 mg"}],"intro_description":"<p><strong>NMN (Nicotinamide Mononucleotide)</strong> is the molecule that revolutionized the anti-aging field. It works as a direct precursor of NAD+ (Nicotinamide Adenine Dinucleotide), a vital coenzyme present in every cell of the body.</p><p>As we age, NAD+ levels fall dramatically, which leads to fatigue, cognitive decline and a slower metabolism. By supplementing daily with NMN of 99% purity, you support cellular repair and energy from the inside out.</p>"}'::jsonb where id = 'af2c0aa0-9a25-4e8b-a003-70876b266cc7';
update public.products set image_url = '/images/longevity4.png', rich_content = '{"faq":[{"answer":"We recommend 1-2 capsules a day, in the morning with a glass of water, to maximize the rate of cellular absorption throughout the day.","question":"What is the recommended dose?"},{"answer":"The rise in energy is felt within 7-14 days, but deep cellular repair calls for a course of at least 3 months for the best results.","question":"How soon will I see the anti-aging effects?"},{"answer":"Yes. The active substances are 100% bio-identical to the molecules the human body already produces, making them completely safe and non-toxic.","question":"Is it safe to take long term?"}],"reviews":[{"date":"10 July 2026","author":"Victor M.","rating":5,"comment":"I have been using it for 2 months and I have noticed a dramatic improvement in my stamina. I do not tire as quickly any more."},{"date":"22 June 2026","author":"Simone T.","rating":5,"comment":"My blood tests have improved since I started using your longevity products. Happy to recommend them!"},{"date":"05 May 2026","author":"Andrew G.","rating":4,"comment":"A very good supplement. The price is fair for the quality you get."}],"banner_text":"Activate cellular renewal and live at your full potential!","content_image":"/longevity4.png","why_recommend":["Independently tested purity > 99%","A stabilized formula for maximum bioavailability","No adverse effects, safe for daily use","Fights oxidative stress from the very first dose"],"ingredients_table":[{"vnr":"**","name":"Purified extract (99%)","quantity":"400 mg"},{"vnr":"**","name":"Liposomal absorption complex","quantity":"50 mg"},{"vnr":"**","name":"Vegetable capsule (HPMC)","quantity":"110 mg"},{"vnr":"**","name":"Microcrystalline cellulose","quantity":"30 mg"},{"vnr":"**","name":"Vegetable magnesium stearate","quantity":"5 mg"}],"intro_description":"<p>A state-of-the-art formula designed to slow down cellular aging. Acting directly at the level of the mitochondria, this supplement stimulates longevity and vitality from the inside out.</p><p>By activating the natural process of autophagy (the clearing of senescent cells), your body regains the energy and the capacity for regeneration of its younger years.</p>"}'::jsonb where id = '0c9fd816-e8c7-4b2f-a6ac-cc508eb11cc3';
update public.products set image_url = '/images/longevity1.png', rich_content = '{"faq":[{"answer":"Although our extracts are very gentle on the stomach lining, we recommend taking it after a meal (ideally one containing a little healthy fat).","question":"Can it be taken on an empty stomach?"},{"answer":"Yes. This product belongs to the Essentials category, so the body needs it consistently in order to prevent deficiencies.","question":"Can I use the product all year round?"}],"reviews":[{"date":"14 August 2026","author":"Camilla P.","rating":5,"comment":"I have felt great since I started taking it, and the biggest plus is that it causes me no nausea at all, which used to happen with other brands."},{"date":"29 July 2026","author":"Florian B.","rating":5,"comment":"My blood work came back perfect! Exactly what I was looking for."}],"banner_text":"The foundation of iron-clad health, every single day!","content_image":"/longevity1.png","why_recommend":["A bio-identical molecular form for perfect absorption","Free of heavy metals and toxins","Needed daily for your body to work at its best"],"ingredients_table":[{"vnr":"100%","name":"Premium active substance","quantity":"1000 mg"},{"vnr":"**","name":"Absorption cofactors","quantity":"25 mg"},{"vnr":"**","name":"Dicalcium phosphate","quantity":"40 mg"},{"vnr":"**","name":"Enteric coating","quantity":"15 mg"},{"vnr":"**","name":"Silicon dioxide","quantity":"2 mg"}],"intro_description":"<p>The foundation of your daily health. Our bodies cannot efficiently synthesize certain micro-elements, which is why a clean and highly absorbable supplement makes all the difference.</p><p>Whether it is immune support, cardiovascular protection or bone health, this staple product has been formulated using only the highest quality and safest raw materials.</p>"}'::jsonb where id = 'bb8181ab-19ea-4f30-a29c-2d77c0b1e134';
